<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n107050" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπεισ-έρχομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>enter upon secretly,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λαθὸν ὑπεισῆλθεν τὸ γῆρας,</span>
			
				v.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπῆλθεν</span>
			, <i>came on</i> me <i>unawares,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ax.</u>
				367b
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάντως ἂν οἶκτος αὐτὸν
				ὑπεισῆλθε</span> pity would <i>have stolen over</i> him,
				<i><span class="en">
				Lib.
				<u>Decl.</u>
				6.38
			</span></i> (
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπῆλθε</span>
			). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>come into one's mind,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Merc.Cond.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>enter instead, be substituted,</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν συμφώνων τούτων, ἃ ὑπεισέρχεται
				εἰς τὸν τόπον τούτου</span> the consonants which <i>are
				substituted</i> for it, <i><span class="en">
				Dosith.
				p.385
			</span></i> K. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>enter</i> a body <i>in one's turn,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς τοὺς ἐμοὺς ἀνθρώπους</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PGiss.</u>
					40i6
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>; <i>succeed to</i> office, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουλευτικὸν φρόντισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PSI</u>
					6.684.4
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(iv/v A. D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>slip into, assume,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρᾶον σχῆμ᾽ ὑπεισελθών</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					689
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
